-- Suppliers: the showerhead's seeded setup (migration 0060) brought up to date with the research finished on 3 Nov
-- 2026: the certificates and rules it needs (EU: no CE mark, GPSR, REACH, the drinking-water mark for hoses; US: DOE,
-- FTC marking, California), and sharper questions for suppliers (the grams of each filter layer, the hose standard and
-- the brass alloy, the cartridge drawing for its own handle, the test reports). The sample tests stay as they were.
-- Only a setup that nobody changed is updated: the WHERE compares it with exactly what 0060 seeded, so your own edits
-- stay, and running this again changes nothing (the setup no longer matches). See docs/sourcing/showerhead-muravai.md.
UPDATE sourcing SET setup = '{"market":"eu","zh":"过滤花洒 手持 增压","certs":"EU: no CE mark (no directive covers a non-electric showerhead: a CE mark printed on it is a red flag). Mandatory: GPSR (under your brand you are the manufacturer: risk assessment, technical file, type or batch number, your name and EU address, safety text in Dutch and German) and REACH (a test report on the hose and plastics: phthalates, PAHs, lead; SCIP if the brass is leaded). Voluntary, but ask: EN 1112 (head), EN 1113 (hose), and the EU drinking-water mark for hoses (from 31 Dec 2026). US: 2.5 gpm at most and a DOE certification before sale; the flow in gpm and L/min on the product and box; California 1.8 gpm and a MAEDbS listing; NSF/ANSI 177 only if you claim chlorine reduction.","tests":[{"k":"leak-15-min-hot-at-full-pressure-with-th","label":"Leak: 15 min hot at full pressure with the stop button closed, then each mode; a dry towel at every joint stays dry","must":true},{"k":"filter-teardown-weigh-each-layer-kdf-55","label":"Filter teardown: weigh each layer; KDF-55 is gold, about 2.7 g/cm3 and not magnetic; grams match the supplier''s list","must":true},{"k":"drop-5-times-from-1-m-onto-tiles-then-ti","label":"Drop: 5 times from 1 m onto tiles, then tighten 1/8 turn past firm: no crack, no leak after","must":true},{"k":"flow-litres-in-60-s-at-your-pressure-eu","label":"Flow: litres in 60 s at your pressure. EU: 6 L/min or more at 3 bar. US: 6.8 L/min (1.8 gpm) or less","must":false},{"k":"spray-force-head-45-cm-above-a-kitchen-s","label":"Spray force: head 45 cm above a kitchen scale with a plate, 57 g or more","must":false},{"k":"fit-g1-2-hose-with-flat-washers-and-no-t","label":"Fit: G1/2 hose with flat washers and no tape (EU); 1/2-14 NPT arm with the mount (US)","must":false},{"k":"hose-hang-20-kg-for-60-s-twist-the-head","label":"Hose: hang 20 kg for 60 s, twist the head 10 turns: no leak, no kink, the swivel turns","must":false},{"k":"cartridge-opens-and-closes-by-hand-20-ti","label":"Cartridge: opens and closes by hand 20 times; still opens after a week of daily use, flow down less than 20%","must":false},{"k":"chlorine-us-water-only-free-chlorine-bef","label":"Chlorine (US water only): free chlorine before and after at 40 C, read within a minute: 80% less or better","must":false},{"k":"box-and-labels-undamaged-no-other-brand","label":"Box and labels: undamaged, no other brand, room for your GPSR details, a not-for-electric-showers warning","must":false},{"k":"delivery-timed-order-to-doorstep-days-ma","label":"Delivery timed: order to doorstep days match the quote","must":false}],"questions":[{"en":"Are you the factory? Please send your business licence and a video of the production line today, with my name on paper.","zh":"您是工厂吗？请发营业执照，以及今天生产线的视频（纸上写我的名字）。"},{"en":"What is in the filter cartridge: the grams of each layer (KDF-55, calcium sulfite, carbon, PP cotton, any balls), and its rated capacity in litres? Please send a photo of a cartridge cut open.","zh":"滤芯里每层材料各多少克（KDF-55、亚硫酸钙、活性炭、PP棉、其他球）？额定处理量是多少升？请发一张剖开滤芯的照片。"},{"en":"Flow in litres per minute at 3 bar, with and without the flow restrictor? Do you have a 1.8 gpm (6.8 L/min) version for the US?","zh":"0.3MPa（3巴）水压下每分钟流量多少升？有无限流片分别是多少？有没有美国用的1.8 GPM（6.8升/分钟）版本？"},{"en":"Materials: virgin ABS, which grade? The hose''s inner tube EPDM or PVC, phthalate-free, made to EN 1113? The brass nuts'' alloy and lead content? G1/2 thread, and a US set with a 1/2-14 NPT mount?","zh":"材料：是否全新ABS料，什么牌号？软管内管是EPDM还是PVC，是否不含邻苯，是否符合EN 1113？铜螺母的牌号和含铅量？螺纹是G1/2吗？有没有带1/2-14 NPT支架的美国版？"},{"en":"Test reports: REACH (phthalates, PAHs, lead) for the hose and plastic parts; EN 1112 for the head and EN 1113 for the hose; any flow-rate or NSF/ANSI 177 report: the report number, the lab, and the applicant (must be your company).","zh":"检测报告：软管和塑料件的REACH报告（邻苯、多环芳烃、铅）；花洒的EN 1112和软管的EN 1113报告；以及流量或NSF/ANSI 177报告：报告编号、实验室和申请人（必须是贵公司）。"},{"en":"Replacement cartridges for this handle: price at 100, 1,000 and 5,000; a drawing with length, diameter, end caps and O-ring, the same in every batch; the grams of each material; can you supply them for at least 12 months?","zh":"这款手柄的替换滤芯：100、1000、5000个的单价；请提供图纸（长度、直径、端盖、O型圈），每批一致；每种材料各多少克；能否保证至少12个月持续供货？"},{"en":"Price per complete set at 50, 200 and 1,000 units; with my logo on the head and the box: MOQ and cost?","zh":"整套价格：50、200、1000套分别多少？在花洒和彩盒上印我的logo：起订量和费用？"},{"en":"Lead time from payment to dispatch for samples, 200 sets and 1,000 sets?","zh":"从付款到发货：样品、200套、1000套分别需要多久？"},{"en":"Can you ship single orders to customers in the Netherlands and Germany (and the US)? Which line, how many days door to door, and are EU duty and fees included (DDP/IOSS)?","zh":"能否一件代发到荷兰和德国（以及美国）的客户？用什么物流线路、门到门几天、是否包含欧盟关税和费用（DDP/IOSS）？"},{"en":"Your defect rate, and do you replace or refund units that leak or crack, free of charge? In writing, please.","zh":"不良率是多少？漏水或开裂的产品是否免费补发或退款？请书面确认。"},{"en":"Packed weight and size of one set, sets per carton, carton size and weight?","zh":"单套包装重量和尺寸、每箱套数、外箱尺寸和重量？"}]}'
WHERE product_key = 'own|muravai-filtered-showerhead' AND setup = '{"market":"eu","zh":"过滤花洒 手持 增压","certs":"DRAFT EU: GPSR (your name and EU address, type and batch on the product or box, warnings); REACH: SVHC and phthalates report for the hose and plastic parts. US: 2.5 gpm federal limit, 1.8 gpm and a CEC listing to sell into California; NSF/ANSI 177 only if you claim chlorine removal by standard.","tests":[{"k":"leak-15-min-hot-at-full-pressure-with-th","label":"Leak: 15 min hot at full pressure with the stop button closed, then each mode; a dry towel at every joint stays dry","must":true},{"k":"filter-teardown-weigh-each-layer-kdf-55","label":"Filter teardown: weigh each layer; KDF-55 is gold, about 2.7 g/cm3 and not magnetic; grams match the supplier''s list","must":true},{"k":"drop-5-times-from-1-m-onto-tiles-then-ti","label":"Drop: 5 times from 1 m onto tiles, then tighten 1/8 turn past firm: no crack, no leak after","must":true},{"k":"flow-litres-in-60-s-at-your-pressure-eu","label":"Flow: litres in 60 s at your pressure. EU: 6 L/min or more at 3 bar. US: 6.8 L/min (1.8 gpm) or less","must":false},{"k":"spray-force-head-45-cm-above-a-kitchen-s","label":"Spray force: head 45 cm above a kitchen scale with a plate, 57 g or more","must":false},{"k":"fit-g1-2-hose-with-flat-washers-and-no-t","label":"Fit: G1/2 hose with flat washers and no tape (EU); 1/2-14 NPT arm with the mount (US)","must":false},{"k":"hose-hang-20-kg-for-60-s-twist-the-head","label":"Hose: hang 20 kg for 60 s, twist the head 10 turns: no leak, no kink, the swivel turns","must":false},{"k":"cartridge-opens-and-closes-by-hand-20-ti","label":"Cartridge: opens and closes by hand 20 times; still opens after a week of daily use, flow down less than 20%","must":false},{"k":"chlorine-us-water-only-free-chlorine-bef","label":"Chlorine (US water only): free chlorine before and after at 40 C, read within a minute: 80% less or better","must":false},{"k":"box-and-labels-undamaged-no-other-brand","label":"Box and labels: undamaged, no other brand, room for your GPSR details, a not-for-electric-showers warning","must":false},{"k":"delivery-timed-order-to-doorstep-days-ma","label":"Delivery timed: order to doorstep days match the quote","must":false}],"questions":[{"en":"Are you the factory? Please send your business licence and a video of the production line today, with my name on paper.","zh":"您是工厂吗？请发营业执照，以及今天生产线的视频（纸上写我的名字）。"},{"en":"What exactly is in the filter cartridge: grams of KDF-55, calcium sulfite and activated carbon (and any ceramic balls)? Please send a photo of a cartridge cut open.","zh":"滤芯里具体有什么：KDF-55、亚硫酸钙和活性炭各多少克（有没有陶瓷球）？请发一张剖开滤芯的照片。"},{"en":"Flow rate at 3 bar in litres per minute, with and without the flow restrictor? Do you have a 1.8 gpm (6.8 L/min) version for the US?","zh":"3巴（0.3MPa）水压下的流量是每分钟多少升？有无限流片分别是多少？有没有美国用的1.8 GPM（6.8升/分钟）版本？"},{"en":"Materials: virgin ABS? The hose''s inner tube EPDM or PVC, phthalate-free? Brass or plastic fittings, and the lead content? Thread G1/2?","zh":"材料：是否全新ABS料？软管内管是EPDM还是PVC，是否不含邻苯？接头是铜还是塑料，含铅量多少？螺纹是G1/2吗？"},{"en":"Test reports: REACH (SVHC, phthalates) for the hose and plastics, and any flow-rate or NSF/ANSI 177 report: the report number, the lab, and the applicant''s name (must be your company).","zh":"检测报告：软管和塑料件的REACH（SVHC、邻苯）报告，以及流量或NSF/ANSI 177报告：报告编号、实验室和申请人名称（必须是贵公司）。"},{"en":"Replacement cartridges: price at 100, 1,000 and 5,000; exact size (length and diameter in mm, the same in every batch); can you supply them for at least 12 months?","zh":"替换滤芯：100、1000、5000个的单价；准确尺寸（长度和直径，毫米，每批一致）；能否保证至少12个月持续供货？"},{"en":"Price per complete set at 50, 200 and 1,000 units; with my logo on the head and the box: MOQ and cost?","zh":"整套价格：50、200、1000套分别多少？在花洒和彩盒上印我的logo：起订量和费用？"},{"en":"Lead time from payment to dispatch for samples, 200 sets and 1,000 sets?","zh":"从付款到发货：样品、200套、1000套分别需要多久？"},{"en":"Can you ship single orders to customers in the Netherlands and Germany (and the US)? Which line, how many days door to door, and are EU duty and fees included (DDP/IOSS)?","zh":"能否一件代发到荷兰和德国（以及美国）的客户？用什么物流线路、门到门几天、是否包含欧盟关税和费用（DDP/IOSS）？"},{"en":"Your defect rate, and do you replace or refund units that leak or crack, free of charge? In writing, please.","zh":"不良率是多少？漏水或开裂的产品是否免费补发或退款？请书面确认。"},{"en":"Packed weight and size of one set, sets per carton, carton size and weight?","zh":"单套包装重量和尺寸、每箱套数、外箱尺寸和重量？"}]}';
